    "5238d80c-25d3-4896-a073-1889e34a08c1/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Thank you for your aid. The enemy scouts have retreated!\"",
      "cn": "“多谢襄助，敌探已退！”",
      "ru": "\"Спасибо вам за помощь. Вражеские разведчики отступили!\"",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "de8d18afeaec1f69",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "5238d80c-25d3-4896-a073-1889e34a08c1/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Leave this place...)",
      "cn": "（离开此地……）\n",
      "ru": "(Покинь это место...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "0efd75cd9616ee0e",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "424006db-b3dd-4835-9271-bbf093879e4d/EventContent": {
      "en": "The enemy assault is ferocious. The Ten Thousand Buddhas Cave stands scarred and shattered...",
      "cn": "敌军进攻猛烈，万佛洞已是千疮百孔……",
      "ru": "Вражеская атака свирепа. Пещера Десяти тысяч Будд вся в шрамах и разрушениях...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "d86c350b9a1eb5b8",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "424006db-b3dd-4835-9271-bbf093879e4d/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Regretfully leave...)",
      "cn": "（遗憾离开……）\n",
      "ru": "(С сожалением ухожу...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "ff2a0adc54d37791",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "56609366-9610-4172-a8f8-1df1e0a4b1be/EventContent": {
      "en": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> notices an armored soldier collapsed by the roadside and rushes to assist him. The man says gratefully:<NL>\"I am a squad leader of the Qinzhou garrison, ordered to defend the Buddha Cave. But the raiders attacked with such ferocity.<NL>Though we fought desperately and barely drove them back, we only managed to buy a brief moment of respite.\"",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>见一着甲将士倒在路边，上前相助，对方感激道：<NL>“吾乃秦州戍卫什长，奉命驻守佛洞，不料贼人竟来势汹汹，<NL>虽带人拼死抵抗，勉力击退，却只争得片刻喘息。",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "555f4be7b857e5ea",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "56609366-9610-4172-a8f8-1df1e0a4b1be/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": "(...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "2d4cf951-1698-4ad2-bf02-893df93ae352/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"The key to defeating the raiders lies in two structures—\"<NL>With great effort, he raises a hand and points toward a towering wooden structure nearby...",
      "cn": "“御敌之法，全在两样建筑……”<NL>他艰难抬手，指向身旁高耸的木构建筑……",
      "ru": "\"Ключ к победе над рейдерами лежит в двух сооружениях...\"<NL>С огромным усилием он поднимает руку и указывает на возвышающееся неподалеку деревянное строение...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "2df376695a7855e0",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:33:58.892Z"
    },
    "2d4cf951-1698-4ad2-bf02-893df93ae352/Option_1": {
      "en": "I will help defend it...",
      "cn": "我来帮你守护……\n",
      "ru": "Я помогу защитить его...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "fa1104f6e6df774d",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "ed85c1f0-04f8-42c6-a17a-88c8220ade0c/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"The method to Impel bandits lies entirely in two types of buildings—<NL>One is the Han Army Crossbow Tower, accurate at long range, able to kill a single bandit with one shot.<NL>The other is a rammed earth platform at the rear, equipped with a Metal Throw that has extremely strong stone-throwing Power—one stone crashes down, Sweeping a wide area,<NL>and can easily crush an entire column of bandits, but reloading is time-consuming.\"",
      "cn": "“御贼之法，全在两样建筑——<NL>一为汉军弩楼，远射精准，对上单个贼人，能够一击毙命。<NL>二为后方夯土高台，上设金刚掷，抛石威力极强，一石砸下，横扫一片，<NL>可轻易碾压一整路贼人，只是填装费时。”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "24f2e712c6f2ab20",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
