    },
    "230abd79-87e4-4b5b-ad28-4c6138288186/EventContent": {
      "en": "The remaining brothers all fell on the mountain path. This time, the bandits are of two kinds:<NL>One is scout bandits, though numerous, they are fragile and can be defeated with a single blow.<NL>The other is horse bandits, charging on horseback at great speed, we must find a way to knock them off their horses.",
      "cn": "余下弟兄皆折于山道。此次贼人分两种：<NL>一种是探贼，虽数量众多，但身形脆弱，不堪一击。<NL>另一种是马贼，骑马冲锋，速度极快，务必设法将其击落马下。”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "1c22064304d3c52a",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
